      "comment": "PURSUIT SPECIAL (1) collided with another runner last time and always well back when fifth (30.56) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance. RED HOT BERNIE (2) has a strong record this track and trip with 10 wins and six placings from 21 starts. Was out of the placings last time (16.41) at this track in a Free For All, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Can feature in the finish. DEADLY STREET (4) goes very well at the course with three wins and a placing from six starts. Comes off a (16.31) win last time, scoring by 4 lengths in a Grade 5 over 275m at this track. Among the main chances. BOILER MAKER (3) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
